州之琅邪諸軍事、衛將軍、並冀幽平四州大中正，刺史如故。尋遷散騎常侍、尚書令，將軍如故。述每受職，不為虛讓，其有所辭，必於不受。至是，子坦之諫，以為故事應讓。述曰：「汝謂我不堪邪？」坦之曰：「非也。但克讓自美事耳。」述曰：「既云堪，何為復讓！人言汝勝我，定不及也。」坦之為桓溫長史。溫欲為子求婚於坦之。及還家省父，而述愛坦之。雖長大，猶抱置膝上。坦之因言溫意。述大怒，遽排下，曰：「汝竟癡邪！詎可畏溫面而以女妻兵也。」坦之乃辭以他故。溫曰：「此尊君不肯耳。」遂止。簡文帝每言述才既不長，直以真率便敵人耳。謝安亦歎美之。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line033:m0185","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line033:m0000","source_term":"至是，子坦之諫"}],"interpretation_note":"明載父子所據；ID分支字元不表示排行，未推母親或共同祖先。"}},{"id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAD","label":"王忱","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"忱","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line080:m0012","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line092:m0157","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line092:m0172","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line103:m0000","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line103:m0059","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line103:m0073","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line103:m0091","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line103:m0127","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line105:m0029","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line105:m0101","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line105:m0110","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line105:m0122","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line105:m0135","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line105:m0161","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line107:m0046","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line107:m0057","c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line112:m0075","c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p002:m0020"]},{"surface":"元達","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line103:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-075","source_id":"s-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line080","mention_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line080:m0012","quote":"忱"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-075","source_id":"s-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line092","mention_id":"c-jinshu-075-taiyuan-wang:line092:m0157","quote":"忱"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b